{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_title", "source_sha256": "4e07b45a01f9c03b046b145cb21f1930113c6e9141dfcf9fcdcd8021205af7f0", "ja": "解夏傀儡カウントダウン留守電", "zh": "解夏傀儡倒计时留言", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "094339cc02b9dc478ef310fe25b56c37fea1a78b2cff9130565637d0047811c7", "ja": "現代伝奇ホラーの撮影を控えた\r\n瑞希からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是即将拍摄现代传奇恐怖作品的瑞希留下的语音留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "a0cad3bdbf3684c0311ab2702767399321ed6e403248f6f59e1a006046dd0e9d", "ja": "{$P$}。瑞希です。\n……留守電でしたか。", "zh": "{$P$}。我是瑞希。\n……刚才是留言电话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "a3ec5988455134a7e2448a8c03bf301afbd4c19e98cbf9edaea78d9ac9b3d1be", "ja": "では、改めて。忙しい{$P$}に、\nメッセージを残しておきます。", "zh": "那么，重新说一遍。给忙碌的{$P$}留个言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "2acf03f49bce142ca0284334413c7f3743b9067a3ba0e072070759b6f53da56f", "ja": "真壁瑞希です。いよいよ、撮影が始まりますね。\n私の胸も、高鳴っています。……わくわく。", "zh": "我是真壁瑞希。终于要开始拍摄了呢。\n我的心也怦怦直跳。……好期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "1e21c27e6455a0bc634abe78ff905b1f9a7d65ba3d21485245869bda81d2fedc", "ja": "映画、『彼ハ誰ノ彼岸』のオーディションに、\n合格したと告げられた時のことを思い出します。", "zh": "我想起了被告知通过电影《彼ハ誰ノ彼岸》试镜时的情景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "d730c308cd88d2cde9294fa81965e1f5dd4382fc872f09c78edccdb0eb118369", "ja": "名前を呼ばれた時の、驚きと、高揚。\nとても嬉しかったです。更に、主役。……光栄、だぞ。", "zh": "被叫到名字时的吃惊，与亢奋。\n我非常开心。而且，还是主角。……深感荣幸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "97313b1a6cf50c655dc02b5997962823ddbf53df2c5cd5f053b69bceec5b59b0", "ja": "選ばれたからには、期待に応えなければなりません。\nそれがプロというもの。", "zh": "既然被选中了，就必须回应大家的期待。\n这就是专业人士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "4f5065bdf54f891a251e64d0430bc36ea10b15328a13dad3f491c08db5881ea9", "ja": "凛々しく、儚く、時に優雅に、時に重厚に。\n笑って、泣ける……そんなお芝居を、目指します。", "zh": "英姿飒爽、虚幻缥缈，时而优雅，时而厚重。\n让人欢笑，也让人落泪……我会以这样的戏剧为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "ea703cec2a953b07db2db8e53362e3cbc695cfb773da58d8acf3122a9a183aee", "ja": "壮大な目標ですが、勝算はあります。\n私には、頼もしい共演者がいますから。いぇい。", "zh": "虽然目标很宏大，但我胜券在握。\n因为我有值得信赖的共演者。耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "91d6060e2ccb60d9ec9fa97ffb7c0854f9be888b8ff52672f00f4c3bc07dedcb", "ja": "みんなと力を合わせて、必ず、いい作品に\nしてみせます。……目指せ、大ヒット。", "zh": "我会和大家齐心协力，一定要创作出优秀的作品。……目标是大获成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "0f7b16f7f3850fd2e519c8b7cbd672c44fd2b71d2fd6af3f85aed509a1c034d1", "ja": "なので、成功した暁には、たくさん褒めてください。\n{$P$}。", "zh": "所以，成功之后，请多多夸奖我。\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_01_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "12ea56220d4f2ebbd3609ee0c9267720aeece3932f10449fe824bb4867f90b28", "ja": "それでは、乞うご期待。\n瑞希でした。", "zh": "那么，敬请期待。\n瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
